Subject: [PATCH 06/58] qwen4_exp: host-resident token embedding tables
 (VLLM_HOST_EMBED_TABLE)

Keeps the token embedding table in pinned host memory behind a UVA view for the
stage-0 target and the last-stage MTP drafter, freeing GPU memory for KV. TP
sharding, masking and the all-reduce are retained. The knob is registered as a
compile-cache factor.
